  "primaryReset": "At paused 12s/main rate 1.5x with external primary, Finnish secondary and FPS50, primary +5000ms and secondary -9000ms render distinct cues. After legacy editor open/close, primary Reset returns to 0, secondary remains -9000, and external caption changes FIRST to MIDDLE without asserting.",
  "remainingResets": "Secondary and FPS resets return to 0, primary/secondary signed estimates are -5517/+3621ms, audio estimate +4338ms then Reset 0. Reopened legacy editor displays audio/primary/secondary 0 and FPS0. Normal Quit and all guards pass; no diagnostic errors.",
  "speedEscape": "Actual selected 1.5x radio Escape returns to track list on GUI05ab1a15. Before native control fails the new preset case; after all eleven data rows pass. The ordinary speed observation occurred before an independent reset assertion; that whole run is not accepted.",
  "failure": "UI-r76 asserts in vlc_mutex_trylock. Recorded stack maps addSubtitleDelay -> SyncWidget value update -> SyncControls::advanceSubs -> getInput -> player lock. Noninvasive stack capture stalled on its last thread and was stopped. Abort did not close the failed test; its verified PID alone was stopped. The before run has forcedCleanupUsed=true and no normal-exit acceptance.",
  "repair": "Relative audio/subtitle delay changes reject invalid estimator values and missing/stale items; only queued native callbacks publish the resulting delay after unlocking. No direct delta notification remains.",
  "limits": [
    "Marker clicks establish signed edit and feedback behavior, not perceptual audio synchronization.",
    "This receipt does not yet isolate rate/seek mark cancellation while the synchronization subpage remains alive.",
    "No full W1, 32-surface visual, DPI, package or beta acceptance."
  ]
}
